# The creature returned is a cost, paid as Spider-Sense is cast (CR 601.2h), so it stays returned when the spell is
# countered. On Bot2's turn 4 Bot2 bolts Bot1; Bot1 web-slings Spider-Sense, tapping Birds of Paradise for the {U} and
# returning it. Bot2 counters Spider-Sense with Counterspell, and the Bolt resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Birds of Paradise
Spider-Sense
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Island
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Island
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Birds of Paradise.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Hand.Spider-Sense.Cast(Stack.Lightning Bolt; Ability: Web-slinging)
Bot1.Battlefield.Birds of Paradise.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Birds of Paradise)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Counterspell.Cast(Stack.Spider-Sense)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

